# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  MedMeet — Unity .gitignore
#  Library/ alone is 24.7 GB and Unity rebuilds it automatically,
#  so it must never be committed. Everything below is either
#  regenerated by Unity, licensed third-party art, or too large for
#  GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Unity generated: rebuilt on project open ─────────────────────────
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]serSettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
/.utmp/
/GeneratedAssets_deleted/
/MeetingLogs/
*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/

# ── Secrets: never commit an API key ─────────────────────────────────
#  GroqClient reads the key from here at runtime, or from GROQ_API_KEY.
/Assets/Resources/groq_key.txt
/Assets/Resources/groq_key.txt.meta

# ── Unity auto-recovery copies of scenes ─────────────────────────────
/Assets/_Recovery/
/Assets/_Recovery.meta

# ── IDE, editors, OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.vs/
/.vscode/
/.idea/
/.plastic/
/.claude/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.opendb
*.VC.db
.vsconfig
UpgradeLog*.htm
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.apk
*.aab
*.app
*.unitypackage

# ── Third-party asset packs ──────────────────────────────────────────
#  These ship under their own licences and generally may not be
#  redistributed in a public repository. Anyone building the project
#  re-imports them from their original source.
/Assets/_Course Library/
/Assets/_Course Library.meta
/Assets/Ready Player Me/
/Assets/Ready Player Me.meta
/Assets/Samples/
/Assets/Samples.meta
/Assets/TextMesh Pro/
/Assets/TextMesh Pro.meta

# ── Large binary source art ──────────────────────────────────────────
#  GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB. The anatomy meshes
#  here reach 421 MB, so the raw model and texture formats stay out.
*.obj
*.fbx
*.stl
*.glb
*.gltf
*.blend
*.max
*.dae
*.3ds
*.tga
*.psd
*.tif
*.tiff
*.exr
*.hdr
*.skp
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
